==Battleground==
*1 [[Doge Dark]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Ghost Doge]]s spawn after 21.33 seconds<sup>640f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*5 [[Ghost Baa Baa]]s spawn after 24 seconds<sup>720f</sup>, delay 20~40 seconds<sup>600f~1,200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Pumpkin Doge]]s spawn after 26 seconds<sup>780f</sup>, delay 16~32 seconds<sup>480f~960f</sup>.
*1 [[Doge Dark]] spawns after 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>.
*1 [[Doge Dark]] spawns after 44 seconds<sup>1,320f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Vlad de Sable]]s spawn after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>, delay 26.67~53.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,600f</sup>.
*5 [[Ghost Snache]]s spawn after 61.67 seconds<sup>1,850f</sup>, delay 13.33~26.67 seconds<sup>400f~800f</sup>.
*5 [[Ghost Snache]]s spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 13.33~26.67 seconds<sup>400f~800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Vlad de Sable]]s spawn after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>, delay 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*3 [[Vlad de Sable]]s spawn after 103 seconds<sup>3,090f</sup>, delay 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*3 [[Vlad de Sable]]s spawn after 106 seconds<sup>3,180f</sup>, delay 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Count Owlbrow]] spawns as the boss.
**5 [[Pumpkin Doge]]s spawn, delay 2.67~4 seconds<sup>80f~120f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 26.67~40 seconds<sup>800f~1,200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Due to the sheer speed and appearance of the Doge Darks at the beggining, it is recommended to bring something that can deal with them without taking long, such as [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cats]]/[[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cats]]. And for the rest of enemies, bring anti-Floating cats like [[Mer-Cat (Rare Cat)|Commando Cat]] to help with dealing with them.

